    "question": "A 240 m train passes a fixed point in 24 seconds. At the same speed, how long will it take to pass completely over a 650 m platform?",
    "questionUrdu": "240 m train ایک fixed point کو 24 seconds میں پار کرتی ہے؛ اسی speed پر 650 m platform مکمل پار کرنے میں کتنا وقت لگے گا؟",
